		<category><![CDATA[privacy]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.securityweek.com/?p=49464</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Google has been fined 403 million euros ($463 million) for breaching the European Union’s strict privacy rules because it mishandled users’ location data.</p>
